  VALUES
    ('ios_crash_gate', 'iOS crash gate', 'blocked', 'Authenticated App Store Connect reports two crashes for public iOS 1.0.1 (4): one on 2026-08-25 and one on 2026-08-29. The 2026-08-29 event maps to iPhone; the 2026-08-25 device/OS dimension is suppressed or unavailable. Neither event exposes a diagnostic, stack, incident/signature ID, or crashed-binary UUID. Exact historical build 7 reached the internal TestFlight group, was installed from TestFlight on a physical iPhone 14 Pro, and completed a bounded cold/live/refresh/share-sheet path without a visible crash, but its share payload exposed a duplicate-percent defect and it has no diagnostic, symbolication, iPad/widget/watch matrix, or post-delivery crash-free window. Successor source 8fc43b48b65d17b3339663549cd86208f62f6bb7 advances to build 8 with the share fix. Protected CI has signed and byte-verified build 8, but durable trusted verification, TestFlight delivery, physical runtime evidence, and a post-delivery crash-free window remain absent. The gate remains blocked.', 'Obtain and symbolicate any diagnostic Apple exposes, then complete the source-current TestFlight iPhone/iPad/widget/watch matrix and collect post-rollout evidence'),
    ('open_meteo_promotion_clearance', 'Open-Meteo promotion clearance', 'pass', 'The complete authenticated Gmail record was checked read-only on 2026-08-29. The 06:05:07 +05:00 request described Nimbo as free and non-monetized, with no subscriptions, advertising, paid features, affiliate links, accounts, analytics SDK, or sale of user data, and limited promotion to unpaid localized posts, one personalized contact plus at most one follow-up, genuine Apple/Google editorial submissions, and ordinary unpaid links. At 17:25 +05:00, Nicoletta Addimando via OpenMeteo GmbH replied in ticket 234272 and explicitly confirmed that under those terms Nimbo is entitled to use the non-commercial API. This pass is limited to that exact scope and the published Free API limits; monetization, paid promotion, attribution removal, limit changes, or other material facts require a new licensing decision.', 'Preserve the confirmed scope and reopen licensing review before any material monetization, promotion, attribution, endpoint, or usage-limit change'),
    ('release_artifact_source_sync', 'Release artifact source sync', 'blocked', 'Product/build-input commit 8fc43b48b65d17b3339663549cd86208f62f6bb7 resolves to Android phone 1.1.0 (10), Wear OS 1.1.0 (1000010), and Apple 1.1.0 (8). It fixes the duplicate-percent share payload found during exact build-7 TestFlight physical QA and adds a regression test. Exact-source hosted CI passed at merge commit 004154227112b80f594e2340ffa05e1efdf1fb65. Protected signing run 33493356066 produced and byte-verified all three expected signed artifacts after destroying ephemeral signing material; the full Actions ZIP and its package/receipt identities were independently hash/structure checked locally. The package is still only in expiring Actions storage and has not passed durable draft materialization plus the separate trusted macOS verifier, so the manifest remains fail-closed at 0/3 verified-current. No current internal-store delivery or physical runtime evidence exists; vc9, vc1000009, and build 7 remain historical evidence and cannot be relabeled current.', 'Materialize the exact signed package in an unpublished draft, pass trusted macOS verification, then deliver it to Internal/TestFlight'),
    ('android_physical_smoke', 'Android device smoke', 'blocked', 'Exact historical phone vc9 and Wear vc1000009 are protected-signed, independently byte-verified, and active on separate Google Play Internal tracks. Google Play delivered vc9 to the dedicated physical API-25 phone with the branded launcher; cold/live Tashkent forecast, Best Time, share resolver, manual refresh, widget render/open, and bounded fatal/ANR/TLS filters passed. No replacement physical tablet, paired Wear vc1000009 install/handoff, or post-delivery vitals exist. Successor source 8fc43b48b65d17b3339663549cd86208f62f6bb7 advances to phone vc10 and Wear vc1000010 for the cross-platform share fix. Protected CI has signed and byte-verified both successors, but durable trusted verification, current Play Internal delivery, and physical evidence remain absent. The Samsung API-36 device contains user data and was not modified. Production was not changed. The gate remains blocked.', 'Deliver the source-current phone and Wear artifacts through Play Internal, then repeat physical API-24/25, tablet, and Wear QA'),
    ('ios_physical_smoke', 'iOS physical smoke', 'blocked', 'Exact historical Apple 1.1.0 (7) completed Transporter processing, entered the internal TestFlight group as Testing, and was installed from TestFlight on the connected iPhone 14 Pro. Bundle inventory proved 1.1.0 (7); cold launch, live Tashkent forecast, Best Time, first-success tip, manual refresh, and the native share sheet passed. Copied share content failed because it contained 0%% instead of 0%. No Nimbo widget render/open, iPad TestFlight install, paired-watch install/handoff, iOS 15 runtime, crash diagnosis, or post-delivery crash-free window exists. Successor source 8fc43b48b65d17b3339663549cd86208f62f6bb7 advances to build 8 with the regression-tested fix. Protected CI has signed and byte-verified build 8, but durable trusted verification and TestFlight runtime evidence remain absent. The gate remains blocked.', 'Distribute the source-current build through TestFlight, then install and run the complete iPhone/iPad/widget/watch matrix'),
    ('domain_activation', 'Domain activation', 'pass', 'At 2026-08-29 10:40–10:41 +05:00, authenticated GitHub Pages settings showed DNS check successful and Enforce HTTPS enabled. The Let''s Encrypt certificate has CN nimbo.uz, SANs nimbo.uz/www.nimbo.uz, and validates for both hosts. WHOIS, .uz delegation, authoritative Cloudflare records, and independent 1.1.1.1/8.8.8.8 resolution pass. HTTPS returns 200 with verification result 0 for all 12 published UZ-root/RU/EN landing, press, privacy, and support routes plus growth, robots, sitemap, and the valid metadata schema. HTTP apex redirects to HTTPS; HTTP www reaches HTTPS apex in two redirects; HTTPS www redirects directly to HTTPS apex. All 12 localized HTML routes have the expected HTTPS canonical and language. Uzbek intentionally uses ' || chr(47) || ' rather than a separate ' || chr(47) || 'uz' || chr(47) || ' route.', 'Maintain dated DNS, certificate, redirect, canonical, and localized-route verification at each release'),
    ('store_policy_console_clearance', 'Store policy console clearance', 'pass', 'The 2026-08-28 App Store read-only check found no open review/compliance action. Google Play reported no policy issues at 2026-08-29 13:12 +05:00; production remained active at 1.0.2 (6), 100%. Authenticated read-only checks through 2026-09-01 05:05 Asia/Tashkent confirm that review request 14 contains only the Uzbekistan Custom Store Listing en-US and ru-RU store data and remains На рассмотрении. Managed publishing is off and the latest verified publication remains 2026-08-27. A fresh logged-out gl=UZ&hl=uz page still renders the old public title Nimbo, so approval and propagation are not claimed. This proves review submission, not approval, publication, propagation, or a later policy guarantee. See growth/quality/store-policy-console-2026-08-28.md, growth/quality/google-play-console-2026-08-29.md, growth/quality/google-play-console-2026-08-31.md, and growth/quality/store-release-recheck-2026-09-01.md.', 'Re-check both app-global store policy surfaces at the next evidence cutoff')
